From 0ce3930cde22ca20c69494f68dc7a1fb7f5a41f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:31:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD vim visual selection in both terminal panes so users
 can copy displayed text

Command-mode visual selections operate on the focused terminal pane and yank displayed rows to the real terminal clipboard. Right-pane coordinates are based on wrapped render rows so copied text matches what the user sees.
